  "summary": "Path to Xtreme is a virtual awareness session organized by the IEEE Student Branch at the University of Peradeniya. This session aims to introduce students to IEEEXtreme, explaining what it is, why participating is valuable, and how to get involved. It is the first in a series of programs leading up to IEEEXtreme 18.0.",
  "descriptionHtml": "<p><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-a193505c-7fff-f2c5-660c-105800a2a298\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXeevAviLNBffEydFF3C1-3nQOMPVf3956sRZJFbeJo60rbyLcUmOd-7nXvSUSkMLXG1Wj9irO4dW50lGblbh3MapqnhHoq-gxLMPuu3yasLjdtLBcRNHI7wlKLpnGxliHyxwiMKnEmKyXIo7lZnj_S5P0c_?key=r6f7qDYts-GqbfroMqcyvQ\" width=\"322\" height=\"322\"></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Path to Xtreme is a virtual awareness session organized by the IEEE Student Branch at the University of Peradeniya. This session aims to introduce students to IEEEXtreme, explaining what it is, why participating is valuable, and how to get involved. It is the first in a series of programs leading up to IEEEXtreme 18.0.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-dc456f09-7fff-a50c-f158-777fadb9e9f0\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdpnOaFmKjSSzKdBszlJ-DdMxtxei4TWDRruu3Klvhe4ngsTaXyU4H7O38aV7Kii7QdqR5hM50Yxw0Sgr8sEzlaJqmBtbbKELaSkYv6_bSD_vXCcZUg-LgzDM7Zjxj1y5AYGKpl1Q_03u08LI1TzuD2jVJk?key=r6f7qDYts-GqbfroMqcyvQ\" width=\"410\" height=\"410\"><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-c5e850f9-7fff-186f-5771-edce3d1f3ed3\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdv5bsZUOPfsPfO_2IL_Tx8ssgaxL6CMvv85b4J_fx2n0ky-YpEAzh9Oo0E7d5hk032NjaTwGKPIp81J-CPESNOAXk7LSXEDUDaG1-JxzYEij0Y7Eoe2WduyZ_fsJVPtNWgNaNGhLp2ztuNstEiVGbdJzhN?key=r6f7qDYts-GqbfroMqcyvQ\" width=\"410\" height=\"410\"><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-9048145b-7fff-4ab9-cf61-c6e1b1e738fe\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfrZztFkpg2r8tlhHT99DeIkySjaxaQysp8ef2BBfX5ZL4kk7NAAm2FbDMP6ELCN1-RzeKIxwxHS_TzQwEvVg15bua-CaSiAvUSCTjIKRAEyggp7qU_DANvdt2lYZ2M904G1xKqEk5gbxJTB8qJ2xsie6pu?key=r6f7qDYts-GqbfroMqcyvQ\" width=\"421\" height=\"421\"></strong><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-50b97f70-7fff-6d34-c3b6-d239ddb6e1dd\"><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdPp1XbWoK